 - [ ] **PREVIEW-003**: When concurrent requests miss the cache for the same preview key, the system SHALL return 202 with the same job ticket and a two-second retry interval while one shared render job is pending.
 - [ ] **PREVIEW-004**: When admitting a completed preview would exceed 12 GiB of cached JPEG data, the system SHALL evict entries before admission so the cache remains within that limit.
 - [ ] **PREVIEW-005**: When a render job fails, the system SHALL release its deduplication entry so a later request can enqueue a new job.
+
+## Eviction Policy
+
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-006**: When a cached preview that resides in the first-use queue (the cache queue holding previews that have not been requested since they were admitted) is requested, the system SHALL promote it into the main queue (the cache queue holding previews that have been requested at least twice).
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-007**: When a requested preview key is present in the ghost list (the worker-private list of keys of previously evicted previews) and its bytes are no longer cached, the system SHALL admit the newly rendered preview directly into the main queue.
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-008**: When admitting a preview to the first-use queue would exceed the first-use queue's byte cap, the system SHALL evict first-use entries, earliest admitted first, until the admitted preview fits within that cap.
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-009**: When admitting a preview to the main queue would exceed the main queue's byte cap, the system SHALL evict the least recently requested entry in the main queue until the admitted preview fits within that cap.
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-010**: When a preview is evicted from either the first-use queue or the main queue, the system SHALL record that preview's key in the ghost list.
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-011**: The ghost list SHALL hold no more than 10,000 preview keys and SHALL hold no preview image data.
+- [ ] **PREVIEW-012**: The system SHALL apply separate configurable byte caps to the first-use queue and the main queue, whose defaults are 3 GiB and 9 GiB within the 12 GiB cache budget.
